            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఆరాధించు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆరాధించు — ārādhiñcu — \"to adore; to worship\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ అమ్మాయి తన అక్కను ఆరాధిస్తుంది. ā ammāyi tana akkanu ārādhistundi. That girl adores her elder sister."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ఆరాధించాను, ārādhiñcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is ఆరాధన, adoration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆరాధించు (ārādhiñcu) is built on Sanskrit ārādhana, \"worship\" (CDIAL 1316), the noun of ārādhayati, \"to win over\", with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
